# U53 e2e (1280x800; c_tree_hover_1080 is the 1920x1080 @1.5 twin): open allflame_exp_001 on the tree, hover two allocated nodes (Pain Attunement, Written in Blood) and an unallocated one (the stat-difference tooltips come from the Rust calc's misc calculator), allocate the unallocated Intelligence node 51923 by clicking (spec:AllocNode, AddUndoState, a recalc through the Rust calc), undo it (Ctrl+Z), then the build XML before, after the click and after the undo. The guards fail the run when the click misses (allocated = before) or the undo changes nothing (undone = allocated). (undone is not before: PassiveSpec:CreateUndoState stores `self.secondaryAscendClassId`, a field PoB never sets, so the undo drops the Lycia bloodline, and PoB re-allocates in its undo state's order; T4 checks the port does the same.)
screen 1280 800
fixture userdir=../user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
snapshot before
move 940 170
frames 2
move 1110 130
frames 2
move 920 160
frames 2
move 900 210
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot allocated
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 2
move 640 400
frames 1
snapshot undone
#! expect-snapshot allocated
#! expect-snapshot-differs before allocated
#! expect-snapshot-differs allocated undone
